        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA, can propose the proposed architecture for this solutione based on our Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform, which includes components such as document-ingestion pipeline, vector store, retrieval layer with hybrid search, orchestration layer, and answer layer." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To support daily activities and fit into existing practices without introducing a rupture in working methods, our will design an API-first approach with REST and webhook interfaces, allowing for seamless integration with Cabinet Vauclair Associés' production tools, electronic invoicing dematerialisation environment, and user directory SSO." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The Atelier platform is model-agnostic, and our can utilize our Sovereign European open-weight model hosted on OuraneCloud, ensuring data sovereignty and compliance with regulatory requirements. our Sovereign European open-weight model hosted on OuraneCloud provides strong grounding and citation behavior, which aligns with the client's need for reliable and trustworthy outputs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of performance, our benchmarks indicate a median latency of 1.3 seconds and a p95 latency below 2.5 seconds for common queries, which should meet the client's expectations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The Atelier platform is designed to scale horizontally, allowing The Atelier platform to sustain performance during seasonal peak loads." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address the hosting requirements, our can propose our Sovereign tier hosting option on OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified and ensures EU-only, renewable-powered infrastructure without dependency on non-European suppliers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This setup will guarantee the security, sovereignty, and compliance required by the client." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

